invalid type: string "📍 Karad\nPriyank Bhatt PG-DESD Aug 2015\n\"We all hear that \"practical knowledge is very important along with theory\". Me and many of my batch mates understood the true meaning of that saying after joining SunBeam. The faculty is very good, masters in their respective fields. The management is also very good. The most important lesson I learned when I was in SunBeam is n